OL,3,AGarvaghy Road residents fail in bid to
OL,4,Achallenge Drumcree decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents had argued the commission's
OL,7,Fdecision was flawed over how it weighed
OL,8,Fup the potential for disorder when it
OL,9,Fapproved the parade for the first time
OL,10,Fsince 1998.
